# Godot's import cache and editor state — regenerated on open.
.godot/
*.translation
# Exported builds.
build/

# ── The workshop, not the game ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Instruments from building it: probes, traces and benches written to chase one question, the
# scripts that take screenshots, and the generators that made the test data on one machine (they
# carry that machine's paths). None of it is needed to build, run, play or verify the game — the
# tests that verify it are everything else under `tests/`, and those are kept.
# Only under a `tests/` folder: the bench is also a screen of the game.
**/tests/probe_*
**/tests/bench_*
**/tests/trace_*
**/tests/shot_*
**/tests/shot.gd
**/tests/shot.gd.uid
**/tests/*.gen.ts.txt
